title: "Erdős Problem #326 (JSP-000272): a minimal asymptotic basis of order 2 with a_k/k^2 -> 1/10000"
abstract: "Resolution of Erdős Problem #326: an explicit minimal asymptotic additive basis of order 2 with c'_k / k^2 -> 1/10000, built from two coprime prime-step Cassels bases and a stage-by-stage witness construction. Includes a Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of the full construction. Code is MIT-licensed; proof text is CC BY 4.0."
type: software
